(4654567, 671918, 71651, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little too small. I would have liked if you could have done it a little bigger. I''m also having trouble figuring out why it''s even because there''s 3 boards. I think this would do well if it was in the odd challenge, it was bigger (640 pixel width) and if you cropped out the little slice at the top and the grass at the bottom so that all you could see was the wood.</td>', 'The photo is a little too small. I would have liked if you could have done it a little bigger. I''m also having trouble figuring out why it''s even because there''s 3 boards. I think this would do well if it was in the odd challenge, it was bigger (640 pixel width) and if you cropped out the little slice at the top and the grass at the bottom so that all you could see was the wood.', '2008-04-23 02:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4654570, 670519, 71651, '<td valign="top">The pink flowers are really beautiful against the blue background. I also really like the rustic look of the leaves and the wood, it adds an antique touch.</td>', 'The pink flowers are really beautiful against the blue background. I also really like the rustic look of the leaves and the wood, it adds an antique touch.', '2008-04-23 02:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
