(4655446, 671382, 92844, '<td valign="top">SQUARE! Too much empty space, friend. Cool photo and it took me a while to figure out what was reflecting what, but the composition is just as important as the subject and technique.</td>', 'SQUARE! Too much empty space, friend. Cool photo and it took me a while to figure out what was reflecting what, but the composition is just as important as the subject and technique.', '2008-04-23 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
