(4655682, 670298, 73235, '<td valign="top">I have 2 commnet: the first one is that you pciture appears to be very flat. a boost incontrast through levels or curves would imporve the colors and add depth. the second one: your composition could be much improved. the sky does not add anything to your picture, so show less of it. The house to the left - the same. your main objects, the 4 kayaks take up the least of space in your picture. It seems like you took this pis frm the height of your hip. Going down is a good idea. Try to go even lower AND a lot closer to your subjects/objects. Try to show us your objects at an unusual angle. The way it is, your picture looks more like a random shot than a composed and thought through picture.</td>', 'I have 2 commnet: the first one is that you pciture appears to be very flat. a boost incontrast through levels or curves would imporve the colors and add depth. the second one: your composition could be much improved. the sky does not add anything to your picture, so show less of it. The house to the left - the same. your main objects, the 4 kayaks take up the least of space in your picture. It seems like you took this pis frm the height of your hip. Going down is a good idea. Try to go even lower AND a lot closer to your subjects/objects. Try to show us your objects at an unusual angle. The way it is, your picture looks more like a random shot than a composed and thought through picture.', '2008-04-23 14:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
