(4656305, 670351, 85310, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry and the reflection; you have most of the parts of a great image here. A few minor improvements: if you had crouched down a little, then you could block out the tops of the trees that are just peeking over the top of the building at left. The shadow across the blue portion of the building is a little distracting. The overhead wire is also unfortunate; too bad you can''t clone it out under the basic editing rules.</td>', 'I like the symmetry and the reflection; you have most of the parts of a great image here. A few minor improvements: if you had crouched down a little, then you could block out the tops of the trees that are just peeking over the top of the building at left. The shadow across the blue portion of the building is a little distracting. The overhead wire is also unfortunate; too bad you can''t clone it out under the basic editing rules.', '2008-04-23 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
