(4657065, 670815, 85430, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Well done.  But shots like this usually come in several attempts, that''s why i was wondering, was this the best position you have for the biker in red? Not a very good one, i think.  It would been better if both his hands were holding on to the handlebar. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Well done.  But shots like this usually come in several attempts, that''s why i was wondering, was this the best position you have for the biker in red? Not a very good one, i think.  It would been better if both his hands were holding on to the handlebar. 8', '2008-04-24 10:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657067, 671367, 26001, '<td valign="top">i think this would have looked better without the background glass</td>', 'i think this would have looked better without the background glass', '2008-04-24 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657077, 671294, 26001, '<td valign="top">this would have been 8 or may be 9 for me, if it wasn''t for this odd narrow crop. did you just decide to have this crop or there was some distracting/cluttering elements close to the subject?</td>', 'this would have been 8 or may be 9 for me, if it wasn''t for this odd narrow crop. did you just decide to have this crop or there was some distracting/cluttering elements close to the subject?', '2008-04-24 10:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657080, 672039, 85430, '<td valign="top">Not the best Optimus Prime portraits i have ever seen :) But really, yes 104 is an even number, but other than that, i dont see much more credit to the overall composition.</td>', 'Not the best Optimus Prime portraits i have ever seen :) But really, yes 104 is an even number, but other than that, i dont see much more credit to the overall composition.', '2008-04-24 10:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657093, 670788, 85430, '<td valign="top">I love photographs that have lots of geometry.  I give this a 9, because i personally think it is a very beautiful shot, in consideration of all the basic technical aspects of it.  But i would have loved it better  had the composition included a living thing -- a boy, a little girl, a cat, a ghost lady''s feet -- i dont know, i just wanted something peeking or walking from these steps. But hey, this could be restricted private property that''s why these elements are not there.  I still love how you capture this shot.</td>', 'I love photographs that have lots of geometry.  I give this a 9, because i personally think it is a very beautiful shot, in consideration of all the basic technical aspects of it.  But i would have loved it better  had the composition included a living thing -- a boy, a little girl, a cat, a ghost lady''s feet -- i dont know, i just wanted something peeking or walking from these steps. But hey, this could be restricted private property that''s why these elements are not there.  I still love how you capture this shot.', '2008-04-24 10:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657100, 671615, 85430, '<td valign="top">Two eyes? If that would be sufficient to demonstrate the concept of EVEN, then i guess all portrait shots of people would qualify.  But if portrait shots meet the challenge, then this is not the best portrait shot that i have seen. I have to lower the score. Cute kid, by the way.</td>', 'Two eyes? If that would be sufficient to demonstrate the concept of EVEN, then i guess all portrait shots of people would qualify.  But if portrait shots meet the challenge, then this is not the best portrait shot that i have seen. I have to lower the score. Cute kid, by the way.', '2008-04-24 10:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657147, 671373, 83375, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I think it would be more balanced if you put them every other one, the evens seem stacked to the left.</td>', 'Not bad, but I think it would be more balanced if you put them every other one, the evens seem stacked to the left.', '2008-04-24 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657150, 672004, 83375, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look really symmetrical to me...the ear on the right is partially concealed by the hat.</td>', 'Doesn''t look really symmetrical to me...the ear on the right is partially concealed by the hat.', '2008-04-24 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
