(4657268, 671217, 73235, '<td valign="top">it seems that you had to quite significantly crop this picture. There is not a lot of detail in the feathers. But the focus is good and the exposure i what you can expect with this natural lighting.</td>', 'it seems that you had to quite significantly crop this picture. There is not a lot of detail in the feathers. But the focus is good and the exposure i what you can expect with this natural lighting.', '2008-04-24 13:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
