(4659378, 672178, 55117, '<td valign="top">Ok. Pet photos for a challenge that has nothing to do with pets is really kind of sophmoric. I imagine that this is a photo you had sitting on your harddrive and you just grabbed it and figured it would fit the challenge.</td>', 'Ok. Pet photos for a challenge that has nothing to do with pets is really kind of sophmoric. I imagine that this is a photo you had sitting on your harddrive and you just grabbed it and figured it would fit the challenge.', '2008-04-25 16:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
