(4659825, 672120, 58728, '<td valign="top">GO BOSOX!  Whooo! This is really cool.  I love the slightly desaturated look.</td>', 'GO BOSOX!  Whooo! This is really cool.  I love the slightly desaturated look.', '2008-04-26 00:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659827, 671978, 77196, '<td valign="top">For this to work, the focus on the flower in the drop has to be very sharp. The sharp focus in the top droplet is the tree at the bottom of the drop. Also, the shot looks grainy to me. I think the reflection on the top of the drops adds to the picture, as does the almost-solid yellow background. You might run this through a purple fringe filter (it that''s legal in basic).</td>', 'For this to work, the focus on the flower in the drop has to be very sharp. The sharp focus in the top droplet is the tree at the bottom of the drop. Also, the shot looks grainy to me. I think the reflection on the top of the drops adds to the picture, as does the almost-solid yellow background. You might run this through a purple fringe filter (it that''s legal in basic).', '2008-04-26 00:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659834, 671730, 77196, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of childhood in Oregon and hiking the "big hill" in early spring looking for the "shooting stars" as my mom called them. Makes me smile. Nice photo. I think a bit less shallow DOF that would have the near bud also in focus would have been better.</td>', 'Reminds me of childhood in Oregon and hiking the "big hill" in early spring looking for the "shooting stars" as my mom called them. Makes me smile. Nice photo. I think a bit less shallow DOF that would have the near bud also in focus would have been better.', '2008-04-26 00:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659844, 671928, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great composition! My top fave of this challenge! : )</td>', 'Great composition! My top fave of this challenge! : )', '2008-04-26 00:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659852, 672032, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice work shooting into the sun! Beautiful silhouettes! Reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=40106" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ShannonLee</a>''s stuff! : )</td>', 'Nice work shooting into the sun! Beautiful silhouettes! Reminds me of  ShannonLee''s stuff! : )', '2008-04-26 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659853, 671766, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! I love the wonderful textures and colours! : )</td>', 'Great perspective! I love the wonderful textures and colours! : )', '2008-04-26 00:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659860, 671996, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great capture, wonderful geometry, and I love those lamps on in the two rooms! : )</td>', 'Great capture, wonderful geometry, and I love those lamps on in the two rooms! : )', '2008-04-26 00:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659869, 671796, 60915, '<td valign="top">Ha! excellent stop action! Great fun and those expressions are priceless! Takes me back to when I was a kid, having water fights with my friends in the summer. : )<br/>(drifting off into reminiscent land now...)</td>', 'Ha! excellent stop action! Great fun and those expressions are priceless! Takes me back to when I was a kid, having water fights with my friends in the summer. : )(drifting off into reminiscent land now...)', '2008-04-26 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659882, 671959, 60915, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the more I like it! Not sure why, could be the randomly placed pegs, the curve that they create, the b&amp;w... could be all three! : )<br/> <br/>Still haven''t figured out the title though, it has me stumped! : )<br/>I sure hope it has some meaning and not just something random you put in there to mess with my head!! : )</td>', 'The more I look at this the more I like it! Not sure why, could be the randomly placed pegs, the curve that they create, the b&w... could be all three! : ) Still haven''t figured out the title though, it has me stumped! : )I sure hope it has some meaning and not just something random you put in there to mess with my head!! : )', '2008-04-26 00:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659883, 671016, 60915, '<td valign="top">The rusty coloured (colored?) textures against the blue enhance this simple composition perfectly. Good eye to spot this! : )</td>', 'The rusty coloured (colored?) textures against the blue enhance this simple composition perfectly. Good eye to spot this! : )', '2008-04-26 00:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659884, 670788, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and geometry! : )</td>', 'Nice lines and geometry! : )', '2008-04-26 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659902, 671730, 62249, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot (I''m a sucker for columbines) with pleasing bokeh, but seems a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge.</td>', 'A pretty shot (I''m a sucker for columbines) with pleasing bokeh, but seems a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge.', '2008-04-26 01:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659903, 670969, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good colors. Good contrast.</td>', 'Very nice. Good colors. Good contrast.', '2008-04-26 01:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659906, 672186, 62249, '<td valign="top">Trains are fun to photograph, but it can be tricky to get good lighting and non-distracting backgrounds. For example, in this shot, it appears that the upper left part of the train has sprouted some vegetation :-).</td>', 'Trains are fun to photograph, but it can be tricky to get good lighting and non-distracting backgrounds. For example, in this shot, it appears that the upper left part of the train has sprouted some vegetation :-).', '2008-04-26 01:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659909, 671159, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but harshly contrasty.</td>', 'Nice composition but harshly contrasty.', '2008-04-26 01:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659912, 670516, 62249, '<td valign="top">This shot has potential. Would like to see a little more highlight detail (for example on the back of the upper guy''s shirt) and want to see a little more of the lower guy''s body.</td>', 'This shot has potential. Would like to see a little more highlight detail (for example on the back of the upper guy''s shirt) and want to see a little more of the lower guy''s body.', '2008-04-26 01:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659915, 671766, 62249, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this with more saturation, more contrast, and a little darker. It''s a cool composition but needs to be pushed more to give it a grittier, urban feel.</td>', 'Would like to see this with more saturation, more contrast, and a little darker. It''s a cool composition but needs to be pushed more to give it a grittier, urban feel.', '2008-04-26 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659916, 671692, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great fit for the challenge, and well composed. Wish there was just a tiny bit more highlight detail in the white feathers, but that''s hard to do. You did get nice detail on the white part of the necks.</td>', 'Very nice. Great fit for the challenge, and well composed. Wish there was just a tiny bit more highlight detail in the white feathers, but that''s hard to do. You did get nice detail on the white part of the necks.', '2008-04-26 01:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659920, 670815, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice. Like the blurred background.</td>', 'Nice. Like the blurred background.', '2008-04-26 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659921, 671674, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''d call this "Well Matched" ;-).</td>', 'I''d call this "Well Matched" ;-).', '2008-04-26 01:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659922, 671978, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The colors are very nice, and the duo drops are great.</td>', 'Lovely. The colors are very nice, and the duo drops are great.', '2008-04-26 01:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659923, 671830, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting is kinda harsh, and you''ve got hot highlights on the critters'' heads. Also watch out for distracting specs on the  background.</td>', 'Lighting is kinda harsh, and you''ve got hot highlights on the critters'' heads. Also watch out for distracting specs on the  background.', '2008-04-26 01:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659925, 671294, 62249, '<td valign="top">A funny capture!</td>', 'A funny capture!', '2008-04-26 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659926, 671888, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs more shadow detail on the tops of the shoes to show the laces.</td>', 'Needs more shadow detail on the tops of the shoes to show the laces.', '2008-04-26 01:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659931, 671753, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute kids but skin tone is very washed out.</td>', 'Cute kids but skin tone is very washed out.', '2008-04-26 01:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659968, 672165, 70484, '<td valign="top">Perfect crop! Love this. 10</td>', 'Perfect crop! Love this. 10', '2008-04-26 02:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660023, 671962, 48954, '<td valign="top">great balance. simple. sharp. hope it does well</td>', 'great balance. simple. sharp. hope it does well', '2008-04-26 06:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660082, 672165, 47852, '<td valign="top">You lined this up perfectly for the symmetry!  The color feels a little dull, perhaps an adjustment to hue or contrast to make it a warmer blue?</td>', 'You lined this up perfectly for the symmetry!  The color feels a little dull, perhaps an adjustment to hue or contrast to make it a warmer blue?', '2008-04-26 08:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660084, 671766, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like that you created an even (symmetrical) shot, and included the even numbers, so that every aspect met the challenge description.  Like the acidic processing look too.</td>', 'I like that you created an even (symmetrical) shot, and included the even numbers, so that every aspect met the challenge description.  Like the acidic processing look too.', '2008-04-26 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660086, 672184, 47852, '<td valign="top">Shot seems a bit hazy, and my initial reaction was that it didn''t seem "even".  I suppose the 2 spires, 2 clocks, and pairs of windows was what you were going for though.</td>', 'Shot seems a bit hazy, and my initial reaction was that it didn''t seem "even".  I suppose the 2 spires, 2 clocks, and pairs of windows was what you were going for though.', '2008-04-26 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660087, 671384, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot.  It allowed you to have an uneven (non-symmetrical) shot that still clearly conveyed the concept of even.  I wish the lighting was a bit more even.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot.  It allowed you to have an uneven (non-symmetrical) shot that still clearly conveyed the concept of even.  I wish the lighting was a bit more even.', '2008-04-26 09:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660091, 671811, 47852, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge, and I like that there are even numbers of trees, and rocks in the background.  Otherwise though, there isn''t a lot here to hold my interest.  The ladies all look pretty bored with the conversation from their body language.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge, and I like that there are even numbers of trees, and rocks in the background.  Otherwise though, there isn''t a lot here to hold my interest.  The ladies all look pretty bored with the conversation from their body language.', '2008-04-26 09:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660093, 672066, 47852, '<td valign="top">Always nice to catch one of these double rainbows!  I might have cropped this differently to take out the hydrant, which at first looked similar to the silhouettes of the people, or else to crop off a bit of the top where there is no rainbow, but raindrops on your window.</td>', 'Always nice to catch one of these double rainbows!  I might have cropped this differently to take out the hydrant, which at first looked similar to the silhouettes of the people, or else to crop off a bit of the top where there is no rainbow, but raindrops on your window.', '2008-04-26 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660095, 670516, 47852, '<td valign="top">The bottom guy hardly seems like he''s doing much here... I would have rather seen two men working together to do the job.  I do like the angles of the ladder though and the shadows it created.</td>', 'The bottom guy hardly seems like he''s doing much here... I would have rather seen two men working together to do the job.  I do like the angles of the ladder though and the shadows it created.', '2008-04-26 09:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660100, 672186, 47852, '<td valign="top">Thinking in terms of "even" my eye is drawn to the sets of lights, windows, and wipers, and the 8 on the second train car, and even the areas of symmetry on the front of the train, but not as much to the idea of #7694 since it has those odd numbers in it.  It''s amazing how much "even"  an be found in this shot.</td>', 'Thinking in terms of "even" my eye is drawn to the sets of lights, windows, and wipers, and the 8 on the second train car, and even the areas of symmetry on the front of the train, but not as much to the idea of #7694 since it has those odd numbers in it.  It''s amazing how much "even"  an be found in this shot.', '2008-04-26 09:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660110, 672103, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry to this building, and I like the contrasting colors.  It seems like this was taken from slightly off center, and that makes the center door/window frames just slightly off.  I would have tried to shoot this as straight on as possible, while watching the reflection in the door.  Also, a bit of a crop to the right to even up the shutters with the left would have made this even MORE even!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Great symmetry to this building, and I like the contrasting colors.  It seems like this was taken from slightly off center, and that makes the center door/window frames just slightly off.  I would have tried to shoot this as straight on as possible, while watching the reflection in the door.  Also, a bit of a crop to the right to even up the shutters with the left would have made this even MORE even!  Nice shot!', '2008-04-26 09:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660111, 671796, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the twist on the word even in the sense of "getting even", yet you still kept an even number of people and buckets.  Nice stopped action too, with the water splashing everywhere.  Bet these boys had fun being your models!</td>', 'I like the twist on the word even in the sense of "getting even", yet you still kept an even number of people and buckets.  Nice stopped action too, with the water splashing everywhere.  Bet these boys had fun being your models!', '2008-04-26 09:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660132, 671382, 47852, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure how this was achieved, but it''s an interesting abstract.  The thing that bothers me most is the uneven coloring on the left and right, perhaps from the lighting?  A nice example of when perfectly centering a shot works well.</td>', 'Not quite sure how this was achieved, but it''s an interesting abstract.  The thing that bothers me most is the uneven coloring on the left and right, perhaps from the lighting?  A nice example of when perfectly centering a shot works well.', '2008-04-26 09:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660134, 671891, 47852, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was "this isn''t even (symmetrical) and did they really count all of those?"  But I like the idea of each flower being even with the others.  This shot really does portray the delicacy of the flowers, and I love the fresh colors and shallow dof.  Beautiful job!</td>', 'My first reaction was "this isn''t even (symmetrical) and did they really count all of those?"  But I like the idea of each flower being even with the others.  This shot really does portray the delicacy of the flowers, and I love the fresh colors and shallow dof.  Beautiful job!', '2008-04-26 09:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660137, 670969, 47852, '<td valign="top">A nice example of how a very uneven (unsymmetrical) composition can still clearly convey the concept of even.</td>', 'A nice example of how a very uneven (unsymmetrical) composition can still clearly convey the concept of even.', '2008-04-26 09:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660141, 672180, 47852, '<td valign="top">Very simple shot to convey ''even'', though perhaps a bit too centered for my tastes.  I also think a slight tweak to the coloring would have brought out the colors of the sunset a bit more.</td>', 'Very simple shot to convey ''even'', though perhaps a bit too centered for my tastes.  I also think a slight tweak to the coloring would have brought out the colors of the sunset a bit more.', '2008-04-26 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660171, 671996, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great photography! The composition is superb. I think it lacks a bit of sharpness and would need to be slightly more straight, then it could go in a gallery.</td>', 'Great photography! The composition is superb. I think it lacks a bit of sharpness and would need to be slightly more straight, then it could go in a gallery.', '2008-04-26 10:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660293, 671962, 47852, '<td valign="top">Like the straight on view here, yet there is so much still uneven.  The title definitely helps to make the challenge connection.  I''m personally, not a big fan of selective desaturation and I really don''t see the need for it here.</td>', 'Like the straight on view here, yet there is so much still uneven.  The title definitely helps to make the challenge connection.  I''m personally, not a big fan of selective desaturation and I really don''t see the need for it here.', '2008-04-26 13:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660301, 671616, 47852, '<td valign="top">What cuties!  Interesting looks they''re giving you.  I like the natural environment you''ve captured them in, without any fences.  Overall, the shot feels a bit static though, but not sure what you could have done to change that with the way they are laying.</td>', 'What cuties!  Interesting looks they''re giving you.  I like the natural environment you''ve captured them in, without any fences.  Overall, the shot feels a bit static though, but not sure what you could have done to change that with the way they are laying.', '2008-04-26 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660304, 670971, 47852, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast of both color and shape here.  I like the reflections too, but feel like there is just a little too much extra space at the bottom.</td>', 'Interesting contrast of both color and shape here.  I like the reflections too, but feel like there is just a little too much extra space at the bottom.', '2008-04-26 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660305, 671367, 92838, '<td valign="top">Amazing, wish I thought of this</td>', 'Amazing, wish I thought of this', '2008-04-26 13:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660314, 672133, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  I love that this shot is so wonderful, and doesn''t look like it was shot specifically for an even challenge (but it works so well for the challenge)!  The little delicate flowers are wonderful, and the way the horses are in the same position is fantastic and the contrast between the two gives the shot a little extra interest.  My only nitpick is that the brown horse is just a bit dark, and you can''t see the details and texture of the fur as well as you can on the white one.  Well done! :)</td>', 'This is beautiful!  I love that this shot is so wonderful, and doesn''t look like it was shot specifically for an even challenge (but it works so well for the challenge)!  The little delicate flowers are wonderful, and the way the horses are in the same position is fantastic and the contrast between the two gives the shot a little extra interest.  My only nitpick is that the brown horse is just a bit dark, and you can''t see the details and texture of the fur as well as you can on the white one.  Well done! :)', '2008-04-26 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660320, 672152, 47852, '<td valign="top">Perfectly focused on that pair of eyes.  What a cutie!</td>', 'Perfectly focused on that pair of eyes.  What a cutie!', '2008-04-26 14:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660571, 671384, 76335, '<td valign="top">Conceptually great and well composed. Lighting seems a little dull in places.</td>', 'Conceptually great and well composed. Lighting seems a little dull in places.', '2008-04-26 21:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660572, 671674, 76335, '<td valign="top">You don''t expect me to count them, do you?</td>', 'You don''t expect me to count them, do you?', '2008-04-26 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660573, 671914, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the colors, but the lighting''s not quite right, and it''s a little grainy.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the colors, but the lighting''s not quite right, and it''s a little grainy.', '2008-04-26 21:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660574, 670969, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cliche with a capital C. But I love it! Very mathematical and fun for the eyes.</td>', 'Cliche with a capital C. But I love it! Very mathematical and fun for the eyes.', '2008-04-26 21:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660576, 672195, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Not sure what it is or how it applies to the challenge exactly, but I do like it.</td>', 'Interesting. Not sure what it is or how it applies to the challenge exactly, but I do like it.', '2008-04-26 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660577, 672008, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and technically very good. Seems to be more of a study though, and not very interesting on its own. I''m giving it an even six.</td>', 'Nicely composed and technically very good. Seems to be more of a study though, and not very interesting on its own. I''m giving it an even six.', '2008-04-26 21:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
