(4660580, 670298, 76335, '<td valign="top">The point of view is unfortunate. Higher would have been better, but I''m sure that wasn''t an option. They need more separation though.</td>', 'The point of view is unfortunate. Higher would have been better, but I''m sure that wasn''t an option. They need more separation though.', '2008-04-26 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660582, 671373, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition. The lighting seems a little harsh. And the scratch on the right is a distraction. I like what you were trying to do though.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition. The lighting seems a little harsh. And the scratch on the right is a distraction. I like what you were trying to do though.', '2008-04-26 21:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660583, 672182, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the sugar cubes (your main subject) are overexposed. This seems like it would be a challenge to light effectively.</td>', 'Nice idea but the sugar cubes (your main subject) are overexposed. This seems like it would be a challenge to light effectively.', '2008-04-26 21:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
