(4660872, 672126, 55117, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, symmetry, and colors, but it'' just not all that interesting.</td>', 'I like the composition, symmetry, and colors, but it'' just not all that interesting.', '2008-04-27 10:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
