(4660881, 671962, 55117, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness, but it looks a bit selectively colored. For the blues and yellows to be so strong, yet the green trees to be gray...that doesn''t make much sense. And we all know that selective coloring is stupid.</td>', 'Nice sharpness, but it looks a bit selectively colored. For the blues and yellows to be so strong, yet the green trees to be gray...that doesn''t make much sense. And we all know that selective coloring is stupid.', '2008-04-27 10:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
