(4661335, 672126, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great geometric feel and very nice colors.</td>', 'Great geometric feel and very nice colors.', '2008-04-27 18:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661336, 671384, 59415, '<td valign="top">It is even in an odd sort of way.  Good job.</td>', 'It is even in an odd sort of way.  Good job.', '2008-04-27 18:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661337, 670694, 59415, '<td valign="top">These horses look a little spooked.</td>', 'These horses look a little spooked.', '2008-04-27 18:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661338, 671964, 59415, '<td valign="top">It is even in more ways than one, which is good!</td>', 'It is even in more ways than one, which is good!', '2008-04-27 18:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661339, 672154, 59415, '<td valign="top">I am not going to take the time to count the pedals.  I am just going to take your word for it.</td>', 'I am not going to take the time to count the pedals.  I am just going to take your word for it.', '2008-04-27 18:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661341, 671946, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is that the stairway to heaven that Led Zeppelin sings about?  I am not getting the even part, even if that is those two dude knocking that chick down the stairs.  I am just going to guess that there is an even number of stairs and vote it that way.</td>', 'Is that the stairway to heaven that Led Zeppelin sings about?  I am not getting the even part, even if that is those two dude knocking that chick down the stairs.  I am just going to guess that there is an even number of stairs and vote it that way.', '2008-04-27 18:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661342, 671785, 59415, '<td valign="top">Two blooms, 9 bugs, and a few buds.  I am not fully getting the even sense here, but it is a nice image with very nice DOF.</td>', 'Two blooms, 9 bugs, and a few buds.  I am not fully getting the even sense here, but it is a nice image with very nice DOF.', '2008-04-27 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661343, 671901, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF on this shot.  A little mroe stop motion on it would have been nice.</td>', 'I like the DOF on this shot.  A little mroe stop motion on it would have been nice.', '2008-04-27 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661344, 670351, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is there an even number of holy water molecules?  I will probably have to take your word for it.</td>', 'Is there an even number of holy water molecules?  I will probably have to take your word for it.', '2008-04-27 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661345, 672008, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like this if it was zoomed out a bit so I see the entire carton.  The crop is just a bit off to me.  I am giving it a 6 however because I like the light and I like the fact that you can count unlike many of the other entries.</td>', 'I think I would have like this if it was zoomed out a bit so I see the entire carton.  The crop is just a bit off to me.  I am giving it a 6 however because I like the light and I like the fact that you can count unlike many of the other entries.', '2008-04-27 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661347, 672032, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - love the moment captured.  Nice silhouettes and brightness in the sky.  IMO cropping a little off the left (getting rid of the partial tree) and about the same amount on the right might be a little nicer but well done.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Very cool shot - love the moment captured.  Nice silhouettes and brightness in the sky.  IMO cropping a little off the left (getting rid of the partial tree) and about the same amount on the right might be a little nicer but well done.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-04-27 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661348, 672133, 55838, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple with lovely colors.  Well composed.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Clean and simple with lovely colors.  Well composed.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-04-27 18:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661349, 671029, 59415, '<td valign="top">That is a very nice collection you have there.  I think to score higher you needed to take this clever idea and apply it to a different background or scene.  The lawn or ground cover competes from my attention.</td>', 'That is a very nice collection you have there.  I think to score higher you needed to take this clever idea and apply it to a different background or scene.  The lawn or ground cover competes from my attention.', '2008-04-27 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661350, 672177, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is this to decide who gets to use the tornado shelter?  Because if it is, I am nervous.</td>', 'Is this to decide who gets to use the tornado shelter?  Because if it is, I am nervous.', '2008-04-27 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661353, 671928, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the lines and the interest created by the people.  Back to bump you up to 8.</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the lines and the interest created by the people.  Back to bump you up to 8.', '2008-04-27 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661354, 672104, 59415, '<td valign="top">Do these two do this every weekend when they are finished with their Halo 3 tournaments? I am guessing they drink Mountain Dew...:)</td>', 'Do these two do this every weekend when they are finished with their Halo 3 tournaments? I am guessing they drink Mountain Dew...:)', '2008-04-27 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661355, 672182, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think you have the right idea here, but the composition needs a bit of work.  I think with a different angle you could have worked on the placement of the cup in the scene.</td>', 'I think you have the right idea here, but the composition needs a bit of work.  I think with a different angle you could have worked on the placement of the cup in the scene.', '2008-04-27 18:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661356, 671016, 59415, '<td valign="top">I am fearful for what might be in those cups.</td>', 'I am fearful for what might be in those cups.', '2008-04-27 18:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661357, 671858, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think she has a knife dude.  You might get wacked.</td>', 'I think she has a knife dude.  You might get wacked.', '2008-04-27 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661358, 671749, 59415, '<td valign="top">I am going to take your word for it.  :)</td>', 'I am going to take your word for it.  :)', '2008-04-27 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661359, 671753, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I think that a little bit of contrast would have added some depth to the shot and maybe drawn them out a bit more.  ?</td>', 'Very cute.  I think that a little bit of contrast would have added some depth to the shot and maybe drawn them out a bit more.  ?', '2008-04-27 18:22:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4661360, 671767, 59415, '<td valign="top">An even set of 3 shoes.  Well if you still where canvas all stars I will cut you some slack.</td>', 'An even set of 3 shoes.  Well if you still where canvas all stars I will cut you some slack.', '2008-04-27 18:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661362, 672020, 59415, '<td valign="top">A different crop and a different angle would have worked for this shot.  I think that the clouds would have worked all by themselves for this one.</td>', 'A different crop and a different angle would have worked for this shot.  I think that the clouds would have worked all by themselves for this one.', '2008-04-27 18:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661364, 671398, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very well lit.  You must do jewelery photography&gt;?</td>', 'Very well lit.  You must do jewelery photography>?', '2008-04-27 18:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661366, 672125, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that some dramatic lighting might have added some sort of effect to this shot.</td>', 'I think that some dramatic lighting might have added some sort of effect to this shot.', '2008-04-27 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661367, 671996, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great shot of an everyday real life subject.  Different, fun, and interesting.  Knock knock....."housekeeping...I''m here to deliver your bump up to 8".  Nicely done - from a former member of hotel housekeeping staff.</td>', 'Great shot of an everyday real life subject.  Different, fun, and interesting.  Knock knock....."housekeeping...I''m here to deliver your bump up to 8".  Nicely done - from a former member of hotel housekeeping staff.', '2008-04-27 18:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661368, 671256, 59415, '<td valign="top">That would be two for sure.  You might want to play with the angle on these to better bring out the subjects.</td>', 'That would be two for sure.  You might want to play with the angle on these to better bring out the subjects.', '2008-04-27 18:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661370, 671373, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think the cues are what don''t work here.  The balls by themselves would work without the rods.  umm...wait a minute now I sound like Beavis and Butthead.</td>', 'I think the cues are what don''t work here.  The balls by themselves would work without the rods.  umm...wait a minute now I sound like Beavis and Butthead.', '2008-04-27 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661373, 672005, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a different shot.  I am not super fond of the angle, but the location has some real possibilities.</td>', 'This is a different shot.  I am not super fond of the angle, but the location has some real possibilities.', '2008-04-27 18:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661375, 670556, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that the flower could use a little bit more light to make it more exciting.</td>', 'I think that the flower could use a little bit more light to make it more exciting.', '2008-04-27 18:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661376, 671294, 59415, '<td valign="top">That is a very creative shot and crop.  I think you did well with this one.</td>', 'That is a very creative shot and crop.  I think you did well with this one.', '2008-04-27 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661453, 671398, 89546, '<td valign="top">This would have been better with a darker background as the objects would have popped more.</td>', 'This would have been better with a darker background as the objects would have popped more.', '2008-04-27 20:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661456, 671978, 89546, '<td valign="top">This picture isn''t very sharply focused. The reflection in the water drops is very good though.</td>', 'This picture isn''t very sharply focused. The reflection in the water drops is very good though.', '2008-04-27 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661457, 671996, 89546, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo, seeing the people in some of the rooms and walking add interest to the picture.</td>', 'Very interesting photo, seeing the people in some of the rooms and walking add interest to the picture.', '2008-04-27 20:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661460, 671918, 89546, '<td valign="top">This picture is really small, would have been better larger. Plus, the 3 pieces on the wall would have made it odd.</td>', 'This picture is really small, would have been better larger. Plus, the 3 pieces on the wall would have made it odd.', '2008-04-27 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661461, 671256, 89546, '<td valign="top">The flowers overlapping make the shot more interesting. With the background blurred it keeps you focusing on the flowers and you arent distracted from them.</td>', 'The flowers overlapping make the shot more interesting. With the background blurred it keeps you focusing on the flowers and you arent distracted from them.', '2008-04-27 20:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661462, 672032, 89546, '<td valign="top">Really cute photo, but the bright place where the sun would be is very distracting.</td>', 'Really cute photo, but the bright place where the sun would be is very distracting.', '2008-04-27 20:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661463, 671685, 89546, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the photo are very nicely captured.</td>', 'The reflections in the photo are very nicely captured.', '2008-04-27 20:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661465, 672177, 89546, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the picture is very gray. Color would have made it more interesting.</td>', 'Neat idea, but the picture is very gray. Color would have made it more interesting.', '2008-04-27 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661467, 671901, 89546, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and capture, but the hands dont seem sharply in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea and capture, but the hands dont seem sharply in focus.', '2008-04-27 20:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661468, 672126, 89546, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting shot.</td>', 'Not a very interesting shot.', '2008-04-27 20:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661470, 671268, 89546, '<td valign="top">The picture doesn''t seem very sharpy in focus, and the bottle that is full looks like things have been changed w/ it.</td>', 'The picture doesn''t seem very sharpy in focus, and the bottle that is full looks like things have been changed w/ it.', '2008-04-27 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661475, 670694, 89546, '<td valign="top">The blurred background helps you to focus on the subjects, which are sharpy in focus.</td>', 'The blurred background helps you to focus on the subjects, which are sharpy in focus.', '2008-04-27 20:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661476, 671934, 89546, '<td valign="top">The picture would be more interesting in color then in black and white.</td>', 'The picture would be more interesting in color then in black and white.', '2008-04-27 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661477, 670995, 89546, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, everything is nicely in focus and lit well.</td>', 'Nice concept, everything is nicely in focus and lit well.', '2008-04-27 20:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661479, 672066, 89546, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the picture is very dull looking and you can see the water on your lens.</td>', 'Great capture, but the picture is very dull looking and you can see the water on your lens.', '2008-04-27 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661480, 670969, 89546, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, nicely executed as well.</td>', 'Very nice concept, nicely executed as well.', '2008-04-27 20:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661481, 672133, 89546, '<td valign="top">The picture is sharply in focus, and is a nice capture.</td>', 'The picture is sharply in focus, and is a nice capture.', '2008-04-27 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661483, 671774, 89546, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting picture, maybe color would have made it better.</td>', 'Not a very interesting picture, maybe color would have made it better.', '2008-04-27 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661484, 672165, 89546, '<td valign="top">This picture is very interesting, with the reflections in itself. The blues also don''t blend together, which make the picture work.</td>', 'This picture is very interesting, with the reflections in itself. The blues also don''t blend together, which make the picture work.', '2008-04-27 20:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661485, 671692, 89546, '<td valign="top">The colors in this picture are very sharp, which help the swans stand out against the background.</td>', 'The colors in this picture are very sharp, which help the swans stand out against the background.', '2008-04-27 20:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661487, 671616, 89546, '<td valign="top">The picture is very sharply in focus, and the subjects being off sides helps to create interst.</td>', 'The picture is very sharply in focus, and the subjects being off sides helps to create interst.', '2008-04-27 20:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661488, 670351, 89546, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the water are very nicely captured.</td>', 'The reflections in the water are very nicely captured.', '2008-04-27 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661642, 670815, 92320, '<td valign="top">Great sense of speed! Well Captured!</td>', 'Great sense of speed! Well Captured!', '2008-04-27 22:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
