(4664270, 671753, 89940, '<td valign="top">Cute boys. The face on the upper boy is a little over-exposed. The background is also a little distracting, the photo would be greatly improved by adding a shallower DOF so the background was not in focus.</td>', 'Cute boys. The face on the upper boy is a little over-exposed. The background is also a little distracting, the photo would be greatly improved by adding a shallower DOF so the background was not in focus.', '2008-04-29 02:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
