(4665728, 671733, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not caring for this, I''m afraid. It''s a good idea, I like the variation in the columns, but it seems a bit busy in the background, which draws my eye away from those great colums, and there is some visible skew on the left. I wonder how this may have been taken form the courtyard on the other side.</td>', 'I''m not caring for this, I''m afraid. It''s a good idea, I like the variation in the columns, but it seems a bit busy in the background, which draws my eye away from those great colums, and there is some visible skew on the left. I wonder how this may have been taken form the courtyard on the other side.', '2008-04-29 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665730, 671918, 83313, '<td valign="top">Way small and excessive JPEG compression. I expect this is an effort for a brownie. If not, you have my apologies.</td>', 'Way small and excessive JPEG compression. I expect this is an effort for a brownie. If not, you have my apologies.', '2008-04-29 20:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665751, 671256, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and good detail, however, it looks like it was taken in harsh midday sun. Some softer side light earlier or later in the day may have been more pleasing.</td>', 'Well exposed and good detail, however, it looks like it was taken in harsh midday sun. Some softer side light earlier or later in the day may have been more pleasing.', '2008-04-29 20:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665755, 671274, 83313, '<td valign="top">What''s the yellow blob on the left half? Butter? These must be muffins then. To be honest, I thought they were meatballs, but meatballs would not be buttered. At least not where I live.</td>', 'What''s the yellow blob on the left half? Butter? These must be muffins then. To be honest, I thought they were meatballs, but meatballs would not be buttered. At least not where I live.', '2008-04-29 20:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665760, 671777, 83313, '<td valign="top">If I were handing out a shoehorn award, I think this entry would get it. I admire the chutzpah to put that twist on it. I like the bokeh, though the light on this is pretty hard.</td>', 'If I were handing out a shoehorn award, I think this entry would get it. I admire the chutzpah to put that twist on it. I like the bokeh, though the light on this is pretty hard.', '2008-04-29 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665762, 670969, 83313, '<td valign="top">Once again, we have what will no doubt be some high scoring water drops. Well done, and a fave.</td>', 'Once again, we have what will no doubt be some high scoring water drops. Well done, and a fave.', '2008-04-29 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665766, 670516, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some effort at composition here, placing the man on the ladder in the lower third. I''m afraid the photo as a whole needs some work, though. There are some blown out highlights, the lower man is cut off and barely within the frame, and the whole image has a color cast to it.</td>', 'I see some effort at composition here, placing the man on the ladder in the lower third. I''m afraid the photo as a whole needs some work, though. There are some blown out highlights, the lower man is cut off and barely within the frame, and the whole image has a color cast to it.', '2008-04-29 20:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665821, 671029, 73452, '<td valign="top">creative idea, maybe in a road would have been a better backdrop.</td>', 'creative idea, maybe in a road would have been a better backdrop.', '2008-04-29 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665823, 671833, 73452, '<td valign="top">cute, but would like to see either more of the girl, or more of the roses.</td>', 'cute, but would like to see either more of the girl, or more of the roses.', '2008-04-29 21:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
