(4665854, 671766, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice and gritty - like it.</td>', 'nice and gritty - like it.', '2008-04-29 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665855, 672195, 85310, '<td valign="top">I find it difficult to determine what your artistic vision was for this shot. It looks like you zoomed handheld over the course of a long exposure. The blurring makes it difficult to read the sign in order to understand its significance (if any) and the light trails are a little too indistinct, especially with the relatively bright background illumination.</td>', 'I find it difficult to determine what your artistic vision was for this shot. It looks like you zoomed handheld over the course of a long exposure. The blurring makes it difficult to read the sign in order to understand its significance (if any) and the light trails are a little too indistinct, especially with the relatively bright background illumination.', '2008-04-29 21:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
