(4665889, 671384, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp with good detail, but it''s not wowing me. Perhaps the broad yellow wants to be much bolder.</td>', 'Nice and sharp with good detail, but it''s not wowing me. Perhaps the broad yellow wants to be much bolder.', '2008-04-29 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
