(4665891, 672066, 85310, '<td valign="top">The raindrops on the lens are unfortunate. I''m not sure what the "six cadets" and largely empty foreground add to the image; I might have tried a crop on the sky and double rainbow only. The colours in the rainbow also seem a little dull.</td>', 'The raindrops on the lens are unfortunate. I''m not sure what the "six cadets" and largely empty foreground add to the image; I might have tried a crop on the sky and double rainbow only. The colours in the rainbow also seem a little dull.', '2008-04-29 21:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665892, 671685, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though it is a touch busy for me. A closer view of the two boats on the right would be nice to see, if you have one like that from this session.</td>', 'Nice, though it is a touch busy for me. A closer view of the two boats on the right would be nice to see, if you have one like that from this session.', '2008-04-29 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
