(4665915, 672126, 85310, '<td valign="top">While I can see some left-right symmetries in the sign, I''ll add to all the people who have undoubtably pointed out that "4141" is an odd number.<br/> <br/>The building provides an interesting collection of horizontal and vertical lines in this image, but I''m not sure the collection of them works. For me, the focal point of the image is the sign; I can''t see what is added by this particular crop of the building.</td>', 'While I can see some left-right symmetries in the sign, I''ll add to all the people who have undoubtably pointed out that "4141" is an odd number. The building provides an interesting collection of horizontal and vertical lines in this image, but I''m not sure the collection of them works. For me, the focal point of the image is the sign; I can''t see what is added by this particular crop of the building.', '2008-04-29 21:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665916, 671753, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute shot, though it''s got some problems. Highlights on their faces are a little overexposed. The ridge right behind the upper boys head tends to draw the eye. A wide aperture could have helped to blur it so as to not be as distracting, or a perhaps a steeper perspective, so that it was not in the picture. Also, your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. It''s only 84k and you could have used up to 150k for this challenge. You have likely lost some clarity  and detail to JPEG compression, though I do not see any obvious artifacts. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.<br/> <br/>Whew! Hope that wasn''t too harsh.</td>', 'A cute shot, though it''s got some problems. Highlights on their faces are a little overexposed. The ridge right behind the upper boys head tends to draw the eye. A wide aperture could have helped to blur it so as to not be as distracting, or a perhaps a steeper perspective, so that it was not in the picture. Also, your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. It''s only 84k and you could have used up to 150k for this challenge. You have likely lost some clarity  and detail to JPEG compression, though I do not see any obvious artifacts. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. Whew! Hope that wasn''t too harsh.', '2008-04-29 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665918, 671517, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s what it is. Could be giant dice.</td>', 'Yup, that''s what it is. Could be giant dice.', '2008-04-29 21:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665923, 671785, 83313, '<td valign="top">The presence of the bugs makes this a a floral shot that is a little different. I don''t know why more floral shots don''t include bugs when they go together in nature. I took some similar shots over the weekend, but I don''t think I got one quite so clear and crisp.</td>', 'The presence of the bugs makes this a a floral shot that is a little different. I don''t know why more floral shots don''t include bugs when they go together in nature. I took some similar shots over the weekend, but I don''t think I got one quite so clear and crisp.', '2008-04-29 21:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665924, 671159, 85310, '<td valign="top">I like the converging lines in the field, but the cottage and the treeline seem out of place somehow.</td>', 'I like the converging lines in the field, but the cottage and the treeline seem out of place somehow.', '2008-04-29 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665925, 672039, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this looks like a snapshot to me. There''s also some excessive JPEG compression. I can see compression artifacts around the horizontal seam on the silver metal in the upper left. Your file size of 81k bears this out. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.</td>', 'I''m afraid this looks like a snapshot to me. There''s also some excessive JPEG compression. I can see compression artifacts around the horizontal seam on the silver metal in the upper left. Your file size of 81k bears this out. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.', '2008-04-29 21:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665929, 671674, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not counting them for you! No time. I have more voting to do before rollover!</td>', 'I''m not counting them for you! No time. I have more voting to do before rollover!', '2008-04-29 21:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
