(4666597, 672165, 85310, '<td valign="top"><u><b>Post-Challenge</b></u> <br/> <br/>Wow ... I must admit I''m a little shocked. I was hoping to score in the high 5s, a nice, measured, improvement over my previous entries.  Instead, this score pretty much blows away my previous personal best. That alone was far more than I was expecting for this image; to win a ribbon---icing on the cake.<br/> <br/>The only problem is, I''ve now set a very difficult bar for myself to surpass in the future...</td>', 'Post-Challenge  Wow ... I must admit I''m a little shocked. I was hoping to score in the high 5s, a nice, measured, improvement over my previous entries.  Instead, this score pretty much blows away my previous personal best. That alone was far more than I was expecting for this image; to win a ribbon---icing on the cake. The only problem is, I''ve now set a very difficult bar for myself to surpass in the future...', '2008-04-30 01:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
