(4666935, 671661, 17153, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for comments! Yes, I should have worked more on the composition of this one and the colors are boring, but this was shot on a rainy-to-be morning just before a microscopy workshop I was attending started. The colors here are in fact boosted, you should see the boring original...</td>', 'Thank you all for comments! Yes, I should have worked more on the composition of this one and the colors are boring, but this was shot on a rainy-to-be morning just before a microscopy workshop I was attending started. The colors here are in fact boosted, you should see the boring original...', '2008-04-30 05:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
