(4667112, 672126, 64537, '<td valign="top">Thanks all<br/>there are 12 squares in the building two of them have blinds<br/>the sign have 4 sides 4 numbers 4+1+4+1 = 10 or 41+41=82 and the letters are 8 on 2 sides and thera are 8 pilars holdin it and finaly 2 lights,2 bords in the roof and maby even number of bords in the building and 2 lights.<br/> <br/>Just one door but must be a back-door.<br/> <br/>ha ha</td>', 'Thanks allthere are 12 squares in the building two of them have blindsthe sign have 4 sides 4 numbers 4+1+4+1 = 10 or 41+41=82 and the letters are 8 on 2 sides and thera are 8 pilars holdin it and finaly 2 lights,2 bords in the roof and maby even number of bords in the building and 2 lights. Just one door but must be a back-door. ha ha', '2008-04-30 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
