(4667437, 672186, 42379, '<td valign="top">Kteach has it right... the pictures has symetry all in it on the train with the lights, ladders, windows, etc.  But I admit to a complete brain fart when it comes to the train number... it didn''t dawn on me that there are two odd numbers in the ID number, I just saw the 4 for some reason... doh!</td>', 'Kteach has it right... the pictures has symetry all in it on the train with the lights, ladders, windows, etc.  But I admit to a complete brain fart when it comes to the train number... it didn''t dawn on me that there are two odd numbers in the ID number, I just saw the 4 for some reason... doh!', '2008-04-30 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
