(4667560, 670969, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first place ribbon. Very well done. I love these rain x shots received my first ribbon on one except it was a yellow ribbon :P</td>', 'Congratulations on your first place ribbon. Very well done. I love these rain x shots received my first ribbon on one except it was a yellow ribbon :P', '2008-04-30 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4667589, 670969, 24846, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well executed, eye grabbing shot. Who cares what the minority thinks. The <u>majority</u> obviously has spoken with awarding you a ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations on a well executed, eye grabbing shot. Who cares what the minority thinks. The majority obviously has spoken with awarding you a ribbon.', '2008-04-30 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4667671, 670969, 83080, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon and PB, and great job with your twist on this style.  I think it''s simple minded of people to dismiss a technique just because it has been done.  Sunsets have been done too, but when a shot is well done it doesn''t matter how many sunsets came before it.  The voters seem to agree ;)</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon and PB, and great job with your twist on this style.  I think it''s simple minded of people to dismiss a technique just because it has been done.  Sunsets have been done too, but when a shot is well done it doesn''t matter how many sunsets came before it.  The voters seem to agree ;)', '2008-04-30 12:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4667724, 672118, 47205, '<td valign="top">Very nice sir! It really is a wonderful area to see and shoot!!!</td>', 'Very nice sir! It really is a wonderful area to see and shoot!!!', '2008-04-30 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
