(4667826, 670969, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh no. . . these types of shots never ever cease to amaze me.  And I can''t believe they are simple to set up.   This is flawless and FABULOUS. . .and I''m happy the voters in mass agree with me that shots like this still deserve top kudos!!!  CONGRATULATIONS on everything:  First ribbon -- a BLUE.  Personal Best.   And flawlessly executing this on your first try!  BRAVO!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh no. . . these types of shots never ever cease to amaze me.  And I can''t believe they are simple to set up.   This is flawless and FABULOUS. . .and I''m happy the voters in mass agree with me that shots like this still deserve top kudos!!!  CONGRATULATIONS on everything:  First ribbon -- a BLUE.  Personal Best.   And flawlessly executing this on your first try!  BRAVO! ', '2008-04-30 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
