(4667870, 671980, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shundaroni:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a stretch. An "Even tune?" Come on. This has been sitting on your computer for months probably. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you believe I have <u><i><b>CHEATED </b></i></u>in this challenge, then request my image be verified by Site Council.  Otherwise, you owe me a public apology.  You don''t go accusing people publicly without <u><i><b>PROOF</b></i></u>!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Judi, I don''t think he thought you were cheating, I don''t think he thought at all! He just constantly hands out these smart ass rude and offensive comments. I''ve just read through the comments he''s made since he came here over two years ago and he often writes that the image has been sitting on their computer for months. He''s obviously never taken the time to even glance at the rules.<br/>Up to last night, his average vote was 2.9! Today it''s up to 3.1. Great, eh? He''s never taken part in any challenge, never commented in any thread, never looked at any photographs.<br/>I''m actually wondering whether he should be reported to the site council. He''s commented so unpleasantly on photos from people who are only on their 3rd challenge, I hope they don''t give up because of him. He certainly doesn''t know the meaning of constructive criticism. My God! We''re here to learn, not to be insulted.<br/>All the best, Judi. You know you''re a damn good photographer.<br/>Irene</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by shundaroni: This is a stretch. An "Even tune?" Come on. This has been sitting on your computer for months probably.   If you believe I have CHEATED in this challenge, then request my image be verified by Site Council.  Otherwise, you owe me a public apology.  You don''t go accusing people publicly without PROOF!!!   Judi, I don''t think he thought you were cheating, I don''t think he thought at all! He just constantly hands out these smart ass rude and offensive comments. I''ve just read through the comments he''s made since he came here over two years ago and he often writes that the image has been sitting on their computer for months. He''s obviously never taken the time to even glance at the rules.Up to last night, his average vote was 2.9! Today it''s up to 3.1. Great, eh? He''s never taken part in any challenge, never commented in any thread, never looked at any photographs.I''m actually wondering whether he should be reported to the site council. He''s commented so unpleasantly on photos from people who are only on their 3rd challenge, I hope they don''t give up because of him. He certainly doesn''t know the meaning of constructive criticism. My God! We''re here to learn, not to be insulted.All the best, Judi. You know you''re a damn good photographer.Irene', '2008-04-30 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4667876, 672177, 3020, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments on this. There were a lot of tough calls in producing it. I am glad it did as well as it did. Also thank you eyewave, I did not expect that and it really improved my whole day, especially since my Sepia entry is going for last place, lol. I have placed it on my profile with honor.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments on this. There were a lot of tough calls in producing it. I am glad it did as well as it did. Also thank you eyewave, I did not expect that and it really improved my whole day, especially since my Sepia entry is going for last place, lol. I have placed it on my profile with honor.', '2008-04-30 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 0),
